	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"伝説のポケモン「レックウザ」が「ポケモンプラモコレクション セレクトシリーズ」から登場。",
			"壮大な雄姿を自分の手で再現しよう！",
			"• 胴体の各節は回転可動となっていて、ダイナミックなポージングが可能。",
			"• ディスプレイ時の長さは200mm超えで、シリーズ史上最大級のボリューム。",
			"• 下あごや腕も可動し、さまざまなポージングを楽しめる。",
			"• 体の色分けはパーツ分割で再現。",
			"• 雲をイメージした専用台座が付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"The legendary Pokemon \"Rayquaza\" is now available in the \"Pokemon Plastic Model Collection Select Series\". Let's recreate the magnificent majesty with your own hands!",
			"• Each node of the torso is rotatable and movable, allowing for dynamic posing.",
			"• The length of the display exceeds 200 mm, making it one of the largest volumes in the history of the series.",
			"• The lower jaw and arms can also be moved, allowing you to enjoy various poses.",
			"• The color coding of the body is reproduced by dividing it into parts.",
			"• Comes with a dedicated pedestal with the image of clouds."
		]
